 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sUZf4qqEafkQ7kNvwHhwJNo&_nc_oc=Adpeg-uM3kMy3MdVmwNO6BLBcLR6LHPqNj7UVuqo--l7hZwnK29c7V8HsvxT2_0syv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHbuhE90WlP9BMrt0arugIZexHtt0wUdQBn0-MbWvHb0Q&oe=6A901D01"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sVh3gcFuPSUQ7kNvwH5ntfY&_nc_oc=AdryhMz_royCGdsDFux1GZ4DzM15PQ-EcLQNg-xQBng75yeDC5Htu56UAcihEAuU3sU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQErFl6mRQ44lodNDmikfthp48etIAKrVzJ5KlV3-gzQxg&oe=6A902A66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TvBq36iJVoQQ7kNvwG_BOXn&_nc_oc=AdrXrUh34Bjkh7Ljn623EBWK3P6pBHdQj2H39vR1-HGpWO-HfDulID52N4BtmChbFlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEAjDw1_0x_ThJsq6Po3YBjeTJjO5Je7t4LwoTj9PunlQ&oe=6A90345C"}, {"fil